"OLAYLAR_ARKEOLOJI_ZINCIR:-0112-01-01:0":{"b": ["Dura-Europos: Dola ya Seleucid → Dola ya Parthia (Arsacid)", "3880f69a"], "d": ["Katika sehemu za Dura-Europos umiliki hupita kutoka Dola ya Seleucid hadi Dola ya Parthia (Arsacid). Taarifa ya chanzo cha mpito: Ushindi wa Parthia (ca. 113) | Chanzo: Leriche, P. & MacKenzie, D. N., \"Dura Europos\", Encyclopaedia Iranica VII/6, 1996 (rev. 2011); tarehe ya kuanzishwa kutoka muhtasari wa Leriche (kioo cha kavehfarrokh.com) | https://web.archive.org/web/2025/https://www.iranicaonline.org/articles/dura-europos | «Dura Europos was brought into the Iranian cultural sphere after the Parthian conquest in about 113 B.C.E.»", "100bc82e"]},
