"OLAYLAR_ARKEOLOJI_ZINCIR:-0132-01-01:0":{"b": ["Bergama, Pergamon: Ufalme wa Bergama (Attalos) → Jamhuri ya Roma", "164fbaa9"], "d": ["Katika sehemu za Bergama, Pergamon umiliki hupita kutoka Ufalme wa Bergama (Attalos) hadi Jamhuri ya Roma. Taarifa ya chanzo cha mpito: Strabon 13.4.2: 'The Romans proclaimed the country a province, calling it Asia'.", "1e50d81c"]},
"OLAYLAR_ARKEOLOJI_ZINCIR:-0140-01-01:0":{"b": ["Babeli, Seleukeia (kwenye Tigris), Uruk: Dola ya Seleucid → Dola ya Parthia (Arsacid)", "433bc35b"], "d": ["Katika sehemu za Babeli, Seleukeia (kwenye Tigris), Uruk umiliki hupita kutoka Dola ya Seleucid hadi Dola ya Parthia (Arsacid). Taarifa ya chanzo cha mpito: Mithradates I anafika Seleukeia Julai 141, Uruk Oktoba 141 | Chanzo: Lendering, J., Livius.org: Mithradates I (ukurasa wa Bagayasha); tanbihi: van der Spek 1997/8: 171 | https://livius.org/articles/person/bagayasha | «In July 141, he captured Seleucia and in October he reached Uruk in southern Babylonia.»", "7c37e7d7"]},
