"OLAYLAR_ARKEOLOJI_ZINCIR:-0147-01-01:0":{"b": ["Ekbatana, Hamadan: Dola ya Seleucid → Dola ya Parthia (Arsacid)", "3ceabd91"], "d": ["Katika sehemu za Ekbatana, Hamadan umiliki hupita kutoka Dola ya Seleucid hadi Dola ya Parthia (Arsacid). Taarifa ya chanzo cha mpito: Mithradates I anaiteka Media (148; kunukuliwa kwa Justinus 41.6.7) | Chanzo: Lendering, J., Livius.org: Mithradates I (ukurasa wa Bagayasha); tanbihi: van der Spek 1997/8: 171 | https://livius.org/articles/person/bagayasha | «Mithradates conquered Media in 148 BCE and appointed Bacasis as governor»", "a34a4560"]},
