"OLAYLAR_ARKEOLOJI_ZINCIR:-0677-01-01:0":{"b": ["Ekbatana, Hamadan: pengo lisilo na mmiliki → Ufalme wa Media (Wamedi)", "7cf90b15"], "d": ["Katika sehemu za Ekbatana, Hamadan umiliki hupita kutoka pengo lisilo na mmiliki hadi Ufalme wa Media (Wamedi). Taarifa ya chanzo cha mpito: Desturi ya Herodotos: Ekbatana inachaguliwa na Deiokes kuwa mji mkuu wa Wamedi mwishoni mwa karne ya 8 (Iranica: hakuna ushahidi wa kihistoria/akiolojia wa ukaaji wa zamani zaidi) | Chanzo: Brown, S. C., \"Ecbatana\", Encyclopaedia Iranica VIII/1, 1997 (rev. 2011) | https://web.archive.org/web/2025/https://www.iranicaonline.org/articles/ecbatana | «Ecbatana was chosen as the Median capital in the late 8th century B.C.E. by Deioces»", "e21b2a50"]},
